<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's BT Funds has 5 pct stake in Hellaby.</title>
<headline>NZ's BT Funds has 5 pct stake in Hellaby.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Funds Management (NZ) on April 10 became a substantial security holder in investment company Hellaby Holdings, with a five percent relevant interest in its voting securities, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Wednesday. --Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
